            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在图片中拖移某种颜色。相邻色系会一起移动。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Drag a point. Click to add one. Double-click a point to remove it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "拖移节点。点按添加。连按两次节点可将其移除。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Drag a rectangle · Shift add · Option subtract · Shift again mid-drag square · Drag inside to move · ⌘-drag moves pixels · Delete clears · ⌘D deselect": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "拖移画出矩形 · Shift 添加 · Option 减去 · 拖移中再按 Shift 画正方形 · 在内部拖移可移动 · 按住 ⌘ 拖移移动像素 · Delete 清除 · ⌘D 取消选择"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Drag a text box · Click text to edit · Drag box handles to resize · ⌘Return finish · Escape cancel": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "拖移画出文本框 · 点按文本编辑 · 拖移文本框手柄调整大小 · ⌘Return 完成 · Escape 取消"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Drag an ellipse · Shift add · Option subtract · Shift again mid-drag circle · Drag inside to move · Delete clears · ⌘D deselect": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "拖移画出椭圆 · Shift 添加 · Option 减去 · 拖移中再按 Shift 画正圆 · 在内部拖移可移动 · Delete 清除 · ⌘D 取消选择"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Drag inside the wheel. Angle sets hue, distance sets saturation.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在色轮内拖移。角度决定色相，距离决定饱和度。"
