            "value": "该选区细节过多，无法描出轮廓。请尝试其他容差，或打开“连续”。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That shape is too large. A shape can cover up to %d megapixels.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "该形状过大。形状最多可覆盖 %d 百万像素。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That text box exceeds the %@-pixel or %d-megapixel limit.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "该文本框超出了 %@ 像素或 %d 百万像素限制。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The 2012 response. Calibration reaches most of the strength used by Version 6.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "2012 年响应。校准可达到版本 6 所用强度的大部分。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Photoshop file could not be read. It may be damaged or incomplete.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法读取该 Photoshop 文件。它可能已损坏或不完整。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Photoshop stroke isn’t supported on shape layers and was omitted.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "不支持形状图层上的 Photoshop 描边，已被省略。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Photoshop text warp was omitted.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Photoshop 文本变形已被省略。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The brush trails the pointer on a string this long, so a shaky hand still draws a smooth line": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "画笔以这么长的绳距跟随指针，手抖也能画出平滑线条"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The canvas could not be rendered. Try a smaller canvas.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法渲染画布。请尝试小一些的画布。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The characters to draw with, in any order: each spot gets the one whose ink best matches its tone": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "用于绘制的字符，顺序不限：每个位置取墨色与其色调最匹配的字符"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The copied layers exceed this project’s %d-megapixel limit.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "拷贝的图层超出了此项目 %d 百万像素的限制。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The font “%@” isn’t installed, so the text was drawn with the system font.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "未安装字体“%@”，文本已用系统字体绘制。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The height of each line of characters": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每行字符的高度"
          }
